# Domain model

## clubs
`name`, `city`, `owner_user_id`, `timezone`, `slot_duration_minutes`, `first_slot_start`, `last_session_end`

## courts
`club_id`, `name`, `sort_order`, `environment` (`indoor`|`outdoor`), `is_active`

## games (read-only in v1)
`court_id`, `starts_at`, `ends_at`, `status`
Blocking statuses for availability: `open`, `full`, `completed`

## Rules
- Times stored as HH:MM or HH:MM:SS; display as HH:MM
- Deactivate courts with `is_active = false`, don't hard-delete if referenced
- All writes must respect RLS (owner can only mutate their club's data)
- Don't invent new columns without a migration note
